Designing Semi-Structured Interviews: A Practical Guide
How to build an interview guide for semi-structured qualitative research: writing the question backbone, designing probes, balancing structure with flexibility, and piloting before fieldwork.

Written and maintained by CASRAI Editorial Board

Last updated 23 August 2026

